      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Total vehicle entrance = 1, exit = 1 (but scalable)\n2. Type of parking spot = 2 wheeler, 4 wheeler.\n3. Types of rates = hour or minute based (assume both here)\n4. Parking spot must be nearest to entrance gate",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Total vehicle entrance = 1, exit = 1 (but scalable)\n2. Type of parking spot = 2 wheeler, 4 wheeler.\n3. Types of rates = hour or minute based (assume both here)\n4. Parking spot must be nearest to entrance gate",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
